  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "340cd2bb53b0751d",
      "translationZh": "为特定应用选择合适的模型，需要一种实用的方法，使用具有代表性的输入对其进行测试。Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 提供了丰富的预训练模型目录供用户访问。在本文中，我们将展示如何部署 SageMaker JumpStart 中的可用模型，使用 SageMaker Python SDK 运行轻量且可重复的性能测试，并在测试完成后删除端点。对于受支持的模型和可用容量，这一工作流程提供了一条可重复的评估路径，不过部署时间会因模型、实例类型、配额和 AWS Region 而异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfbeefde0333381c",
      "translationZh": "2026 年，SageMaker JumpStart 引入了两项改进，简化了模型发现和部署。在 Amazon SageMaker AI 控制台的 Model Hub 部分，你可以浏览 SageMaker JumpStart 目录、查看示例笔记本，并直接在 SageMaker Studio 中打开它们。预配置的端点部署选项提供了具名配置，针对低成本、低延迟或通用工作负载等优先需求进行优化，涵盖多种生成式 AI 模型，其中包括针对 Neuron 优化的配置。此外，借助新的深度链接集成，你现在可以一键从 Hugging Face 模型发现跳转到 SageMaker AI 部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fb5a6432a1977e4",
      "translationZh": "我们的方法使用一个可复用的 Python 脚本，执行以下三个步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bb32f2224fdb3dc",
      "translationZh": "从 SageMaker JumpStart 中发现并部署模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b0663ea79aa463a",
      "translationZh": "运行针对特定模型的示例提示词，并测量延迟、近似输出长度和单请求生成速率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d92519101b118d7",
      "translationZh": "清理端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2e24b2372512b62",
      "translationZh": "这一模式适用于许多兼容的 SageMaker JumpStart 模型，不过载荷格式、所需的实例类型、最终用户许可协议（EULA）要求和响应结构可能需要针对具体模型进行调整。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d24b1d8c9f1e425",
      "translationZh": "一个具有 SageMaker AI 权限的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5489275df04890ab",
      "translationZh": "Python 3+，并已安装 SageMaker Python SDK v3（pip install \"sagemaker>=3,<4\"）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3aa50cf20c27e015",
      "translationZh": "拥有足以测试目标模型的 GPU 实例配额，或申请提高配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "559be6cad34ec66c",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1.a：发现可用模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b70a5bf8fbf3cd0a",
      "translationZh": "在 SageMaker JumpStart 中查找模型的 UI 路径：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "162b8aa663e5c535",
      "translationZh": "图 1：在 SageMaker Studio 中的 SageMaker JumpStart Models 页面上浏览模型目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37460008715eeb41",
      "translationZh": "使用 SageMaker Python SDK 的代码路径：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26b2c81e5037498b",
      "translationZh": "或按模型名称搜索：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dbf0331acaba4b3b",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1.b：部署模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6402d80e48f312dc",
      "translationZh": "从 SageMaker JumpStart 部署模型的 UI 路径：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "916b62a8b6c0b537",
      "translationZh": "图 2：在 SageMaker Studio 中，从模型的 SageMaker JumpStart 详情页部署模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a8466fdf80ed1926",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：运行示例提示词并衡量性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41193bb7800a2f28",
      "translationZh": "这种模式适用于许多可用的 SageMaker JumpStart 模型，但负载格式、所需的实例类型、EULA 和响应解析可能需要针对特定模型进行调整。通过使用一致的测试提示词，并衡量不同模型的延迟、吞吐量和输出质量，你可以比较各个选项，选择适合你工作负载的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a609773ebe129a7a",
      "translationZh": "尝试将这种方法用于 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 中的不同模型，为你的应用找到质量、速度和成本之间的恰当平衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7ece39395812ef2",
      "translationZh": "SageMaker Python SDK 文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95846555ad2a9939",
